flowchart TD
    StartNode([● User Authenticated & Enters Platform]):::nodeStart --> ActivityChoice{Select Platform Activity}:::decisionStyle

    ActivityChoice -->|Practice Solo| SoloPath[Browse Problem Catalogue & Filter by Tag/Difficulty]:::practiceStyle
    SoloPath --> OpenProblem[Open Problem Workspace & Load Monaco Editor]:::practiceStyle
    OpenProblem --> WriteCode[Write / Edit Algorithmic Solution]:::practiceStyle
    WriteCode --> TestChoice{Run Sample Tests?}:::decisionStyle
    
    TestChoice -->|Yes| ExecSample[Execute in Local AST Sandbox Context]:::practiceStyle
    ExecSample --> DisplayResults[Display Test Output, Execution Time & Diff]:::practiceStyle
    DisplayResults --> WriteCode
    
    TestChoice -->|No| SubmitSolution[Submit Final Algorithmic Solution]:::practiceStyle
    SubmitSolution --> ScanAST[AST Lexical Guard Scans for Forbidden Tokens]:::practiceStyle
    ScanAST --> ASTCheck{Security Pass?}:::decisionStyle
    ASTCheck -->|No| SecurityAlert[Display Security Violation Warning]:::errorStyle
    SecurityAlert --> WriteCode
    ASTCheck -->|Yes| EvalHidden[Evaluate Against Hidden & Edge Test Cases]:::practiceStyle
    EvalHidden --> GradingCheck{All Test Cases Passed?}:::decisionStyle
    GradingCheck -->|No| ShowFailures[Inspect Failed Test Diagnostics]:::practiceStyle
    ShowFailures --> WriteCode
    GradingCheck -->|Yes| UpdateStats[Increment Solved Count, Streaks & Save Submission]:::practiceStyle
    UpdateStats --> PracticeComplete([● Practice Activity Complete]):::nodeEnd

    ActivityChoice -->|1v1 Coding Battle| BattleMode{Host or Join Battle?}:::decisionStyle
    BattleMode -->|Create Room| CreateLobby[Configure Difficulty, Duration & Generate 6-Char Code]:::battleStyle
    CreateLobby --> WaitOpponent[Wait in Lobby for Opponent to Connect]:::battleStyle
    BattleMode -->|Join Room| EnterCode[Enter 6-Character Room Code]:::battleStyle
    EnterCode --> JoinLobby[Connect to Socket Room Namespace]:::battleStyle
    WaitOpponent --> ReadyHandshake[Both Players Signal Ready]:::battleStyle
    JoinLobby --> ReadyHandshake
    ReadyHandshake --> Countdown[Server Broadcasts 5-Second Synchronized Countdown]:::battleStyle
    Countdown --> BattleDuel[Simultaneous Live Coding Duel with Progress Telemetry]:::battleStyle
    BattleDuel --> BattleSubmit[Submit Final Duel Solution]:::battleStyle
    BattleSubmit --> DuelGrade{Passed 100% Tests First?}:::decisionStyle
    DuelGrade -->|Yes| WinMatch[Declared Match Winner: +100 ELO Rating]:::winStyle
    DuelGrade -->|No / Time Expired| ConcludeMatch[Match Concluded: ELO Rating Adjusted]:::battleStyle
    WinMatch --> BattleComplete([● Battle Duel Concluded]):::nodeEnd
    ConcludeMatch --> BattleComplete

